= Lightweight Anomaly Detection for Supply Chain Event Monitoring
== Abstract
We propose a compact anomaly watch pipeline for shipment event features under noisy conditions. The method emphasizes low-cost inference, interpretable alerts, and CI reproducibility.

== Method
IsolationForest/LOF on engineered time and delay features with threshold calibration.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
